ok   require returns the nested Params when present and non-empty
ok   require raises ParameterMissing when absent or empty
ok   permit returns only listed scalar keys that are present
ok   expect returns the permitted shape
ok   expect raises 400's ParameterMissing for a missing key or a wrong shape
ok   expect raises when a nested Hash is sent where a list is expected
ok   expect with a bare key answers a one-entry Hash, raising for a missing or non-String value
ok   expect with a list spec answers the list in a one-entry Hash
ok   a filter that is not an Array, or an Array among the filters, is an ArgumentError
ok   expect drops an unlisted key inside a nested level
ok   expect takes a spec of exactly one key
ok   expect never returns an uploaded file
ok   require(...).permit gains the nested and array forms
ok   a list sent where a scalar is permitted is dropped, not coerced
ok   set_upload_path nests like set_path and never appends
ok   require succeeds for a form that sent only a file
ok   permit never returns a file
ok   a file's bytes survive the Params unchanged (NUL and high bytes)
